<title>BELGIUM: EU says most aid to Hoffmann-Laroche illegal.</title>
<headline>EU says most aid to Hoffmann-Laroche illegal.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-05-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Commission said on Wednesday it had declared illegal 340 million schillings in Austrian aid to Roche Holding AG's Hoffman-Laroche for its new anti-obesity drug Orlistat but approved another 42.8 million schillings on environmental grounds.</p>
<p>Further details were not immediately available. -- Brussels Newsroom 32 2 287 6800</p>
</text>
